---
Bundle 808 samples with standalone executable.

Include the default 808 sample kit in the standalone distribution so
it works out of the box without requiring separate sample downloads.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] 808 samples included in build output or install directory
- [ ] Engine finds samples at runtime via relative path from executable
- [ ] Samples load on first launch without configuration
- [ ] CMake install target copies samples to correct location

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and install, verify samples present in output directory
- [ ] Launch from install directory, verify 808 kit loads
- [ ] Launch from different working directory, verify samples still found
